{"id": "Dfg0UZvyeda", "title": "Video by devanshu.motion", "description": "Sources: Kalpa Sutra (Bhadrabahu), Jinacharitra, Jacobi ka anuvaad aur Prakrit mool\n\nDiwali par Jain parivaar diye kyun jalate hain? 🪔\n\nKartik amavasya ki raat Pava nagri mein Mahavir Swami ko nirvana prapt hua. Usi raat unke sabse bade shishya Gautam ko bhi kevalgyan mila, aur Kashi aur Koshal ke atharah rajaon ne kaha ki gyaan ka ujaala chala gaya hai, toh ab hum diyon ka ujaala karenge.\n\nYeh poori katha Kalpa Sutra se hai, jo Shwetambar parampara ka granth hai. Digambar parampara mein kuch baatein alag hain, unke granth pinned comment mein hain.\n\n#mahavirswami #nirvana #jainism #diwali #jaindiwali", "channel": "devanshu.motion", "uploader_id": "25176808901", "uploader": "Devanshu Singhai", "timestamp": 1794210208, "like_count": 3661, "comment_count": 37, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/146.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1835276174162405a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 51.135, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr2-3.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQMhU4881zM-DrWAOKntSq0Dh4aLnz8K3-JCXnTh3YpB2pXqmggSQXL12qf3kp-yyDtO_AhoSptFgl4QYRXOmHrghxsKGDtmdxO18ck.mp4?_nc_cat=105&_nc_oc=Adqx2Cx5fnFWvAXB3dfQzTnuSKYXJq2vbAaV2mcYnxTVHghPaYH__vBulCpAvdn6wFisss7pUSBWSHU5fk_WmO4p&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr2-3.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=atnp0lW80c4Q7kNvwEvXksa&%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=n7FprcE8CMmrLcpoc9C8Hw&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQTsOJr6nbkdPZjW_Gs8DwKDYhWVp0Ly4uYrIRP3GHRAkA&oe=6AF44F12", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "vid