 a Shwetambar Jain and I can tell you there is nothing interesting about Jainism.", "timestamp": 1794256687, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "sahilmaniyar", "author_id": "413086831", "id": "18590059033068654", "text": "Kartik ki amavasya diwali nahi aati. Ashwina ki amavasya ko aati hai. Aur tab hi bhagwan ka nirvan hua tha.", "timestamp": 1794249165, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "devanshu.motion", "author_id": "25176808901", "id": "17916788538544856", "text": "Yeh katha sirf Kalpa Sutra se hai (Shwetambar parampara). Digambar parampara ke Uttarapurana aur Harivamsha Purana mein kuch baatein alag hain, jaise garbh aur vivah ke prasang. Harivamsha Purana (sarga 66) ke anusaar Pava ka aakash jagmaga utha, devon ne deep jalaye, aur tabse log har saal Dipalika par Jinendra ki pooja karte hain. Pava, Kartik amavasya ke aas paas ka samay, devon ka prakash aur Gautam ka kevalgyan, yeh dono paramparaon mein milta hai. Aapke parivaar mein yeh katha kaise sunayi jaati hai", "timestamp": 1794246497, "like_count": 5}, {"author": "happyjain524", "author_id": "16953934524", "id": "17952801873055319", "text": "जैनं जयतु शासनं 🙌", "timestamp": 1794245901, "like_count": 1}, {"author": "__kathansh_jain", "author_id": "54782543933", "id": "18123146440941124", "text": "Jai jinendra 🙌👏", "timestamp": 1794245718, "like_count": 1}, {"author": "silver_leo91", "author_id": "42167615617", "id": "18351702238271691", "text": "Completely worng story kuchh bhi", "timestamp": 1794245593, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "__heeth.r__", "author_id": "9521961573", "id": "18114698354125955", "text": "All together a great video but some corrections for the video. 1) Prabhu veer was given the name Mahavir when he was a kid and Indra was praising him to another devta the devta thought to himself what is so great about this human kid that Devraj Indra himself is praising him so he thought of testing prabhu he first came as a giant snake when prabhu who was a kid playing with his friends, his friends frightened by this giant snake ran away but prabhu picked the snake by it’s tail swung it around and threw hum away later the same Dev came back as a giant demon this time prabhu veer struck jumped up high into the air joined his wrists by interlocking his fingers and hitting the demon on it’s head causing him to be buried under the ground from below his neck after some time the Dev came his original form and asked for forgiveness from prabhu for not trusting him and testing him and as a gratitude named him Mahavir.\n2) it’s not baal ukhadna it’s called kesh lochan this is done by all the tirthankaras where when they take Diksha they remove the hair from their head by their own hands within five times this is called pancha mishti locha all tirthankaras have done this except the first tirthankara prabhu aadinath he had done only chau mushti loch(4 mushti loch) as when he was about to do the fifth musthi Devraj Indra requested him not to and to keep importance of the words of Indra he stopped.\nExcept these two corrections according to me everything else said in the video seems correct. \nJai Jinendra🙏🏻\nJai Mahaveer🙏🏻", "timestamp": 1794244589, "like_count": 5}, {"author": "jvandan", "author_id": "1532405825", "id": "17911100544589094", "text": "Kuch bhi fake and totally wrong  story... You need to do swadhyay more correctly", "timestamp": 1794241818, "like_count": 2}, {"author": "akarshi_jain04", "author_id": "62765240106", "id": "18104466020379124", "text": "बाल उखाड़े नहीं केश लॉन्च किया 🙏🏻", "timestamp": 1794240123, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "khushij_012", "author_id": "52376161882", "id": "18069046373785890", "text": "🙏🏻🙏🏻", "timestamp": 1794236031, "like_count": 1}, {"author": "dakshoe.18", "author_id": "30978943755", "id": "18122522338975336", "text": "Veero ke veer mahaveer 🥹❤️❤️❤️❤️", "timestamp": 1794233997, "like_count": 1}], "webpage_url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/Dfg0UZvyeda/", "webpage_url_basename": "Dfg0UZvyeda", "webpage_url_domain": "instagram.com", "ext